    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: 'although these books might seem like colored

      rectangles, i can
      actually read them, '
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
    autoAdvanceAfter: 0
  - text: "And no, i don't know why the flower pots \ndon't have a texture. I'm still
      a amateur\nat this 3D stuff you know?\nBut you can inspect them if you want! "
    tint: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
    fps: 24
